MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstQuest_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1e1b723f256c36b46a47dc0c69e8c0a3, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4291153920
    m_Localized: "Ohhh\u2026 look who\u2019s finally awake! And\u2026 probably a
      bit confused. Let me guess \u2014 \tcrash landing, memory loss, existential
      crisis? Yeah?\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 129533071360
    m_Localized: "Perfect. Initializing ReMember Protocol\u2122. Try not to die again
      right away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151720939520
    m_Localized: Alright, time to stretch those legs. Move with W, A, S and D. Look
      around with your mouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168032587776
    m_Localized: "Hold Shift to sprint. Unless you\u2019re a fan of dying at a snail\u2019s
      pace."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180942655488
    m_Localized: "Wanna get some airtime? Hit Spacebar. Think you can fly? You can\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 196927148032
    m_Localized: Use 1 through 3 to equip your weapons. Left click to shoot. If you
      actually want to hit something, try using right click to aim.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 209350676480
    m_Localized: "When you\u2019ve inevitably wasted all your ammo, press R to reload."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 222755672064
    m_Localized: "Your current objectives are displayed in the top right. So when
      you\u2019re lost, maybe check there.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 238408814592
    m_Localized: "Right before the crash, my radar picked up some structures. Good
      news: we\u2019re not alone. Bad news: you flew straight through them\u2026\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 251847364608
    m_Localized: "Maybe go pay them a visit. Let\u2019s hope they\u2019re not too
      mad. Who knows, you might find something useful.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264321224704
    m_Localized: Oh, look at you, achieving something for once. Excellent. Install
      it into the ship ASAP, could be important data on there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
